      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "title": "Config",
      "text": "A **config** is a mod's settings file. Whoever runs the game or server can change it.\\\n\\\n\"Set by config\" means the value can differ in your world. Files sit in the config folder; some open from the Mods menu."
    },
